            <ArticleTitle>Group therapy with rheumatoid arthritic patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>288-99</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A husband-wife co-therapist team, in clinical collaboration with rheumatologists of the Phoenix Arthritis Center, has instituted a brief inpatient group therapy program in an arthritis unit of a general medical hospital. Problems of initiating the group are presented. Both preliminary findings and research possibilities are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
